! Changelog

!! v1.9.0

* Update dependencies and fix the TypeScript config.
* Keep whiteboard menu items clickable across multiple boards.
* Stop toolbar hover from triggering unnecessary tldraw overflow recalculations that caused ResizeObserver loop browser errors.

!! v1.8.3

* Add jasmine unit tests covering plugin registration, file-type, migration regex, sidebar state, and create flow.
* Update CI workflows to use actions/cache@v4.

!! v1.8.2

* Add whiteboard sidebar workflow for switching and creating boards in layout mode.
* Use core title editing mechanism in create flow for duplicate-title feedback.
* Add compatibility migration for legacy "wikitext-note" records when loading whiteboard data.
